WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Open the local catalogue
Six recipes are available; fictitious workshop with no real payment.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Check Vegetarian only
Three recipes remain visible.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Order one Margherita with fictitious contact details
EUR 9.50 excluding delivery: the server rejects an order below EUR 10.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Use Arrow up to set the quantity to two
EUR 19.00 for pizzas + EUR 2.90 delivery = EUR 21.90.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Confirm then open My tracking
An order number appears. The initial status is Received.
